:: Carter Trampoline Superhero Flip [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
<span style="Color: LightGreen">You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> are jumping and hopping around on his trampoline, enjoying the cool breeze and adrenaline that hits you with every jump.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> is ever an active lad, jumping in the middle to get as much power as possible. His light body allows him to get some incredible height, despite his weak little legs. <span style="Color: Pink">It is kind of fun watching him show off his skills so proudly with just his little swimming trunks keeping him decent. They look a tad loose and you can’t help but notice the drawstrings becoming more and more undone with every jump.</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Smirk",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "Carter",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Swim",
            Mouth: "Happy",
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey! Watch this!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> says, slowing down to prepare a big jump, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I can do this really cool flip! Like they do in the cartoons, watch!”</span> <span style="Color: Pink">You look on with an amused expression, perhaps having a thought or hope about what is about to happen.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“They key is to get some height beforehand, then you just gotta go fast and commit! If you hesitate or get afraid, you won’t rotate all the way and will land on your face! Alright, watch closely!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> takes a few hops to gain height, bending his knees low to get more recoil. Then, once he is ready, he swings his legs into the air in an incredible flip! <br>
<br>

<<linkreplace"Continue">>
    <span style="Color: Pink">WHIP!</span> <br>
    <br>
    <span style="Color: Pink">As <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> flips, a red blur flies off his body! Your eyes widen as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s trunks, already loosened, are sent flying over the trampoline net and into the pool due to the speed of his flip. His commitment to completing the flip also proves to be his downfall as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> lands on his feet, now butt naked!</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Smirk",
                    Eyes: "Tired",
                    Blush: 1,
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "Carter",
                ShowZooms: true,
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Naked",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Blush : 2,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Ahhhhh!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> <span style="Color: Pink">lets out a cry of embarrassment, quickly bending down and covering his exposed little crotch as you can’t help but start laughing, finding the situation hilarious.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“S- stop laughing! Where did they go!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> glances around before spotting the red trunks floating in the pool. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> <span style="Color: Pink">quickly rushes out of the trampoline, showing you his cute little butt as he does so, and dives into the pool to retrieve them.</span> <br>
    <br>
    You watch as he surfaces and quickly puts them on, before looking up at you with an annoyed expression. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It’s not funny!”</span> <span style="Color: Pink">Though <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> can’t hide his smirk, embarrassed but finding humor in sending his only piece of clothing flying across the yard. It was rather hilarious.</span> <br>
    <span style="color:Red">-Carter Energy</span><br>
    <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 10>>
    <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
    <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
    <<needChange "Fun" 10>>
    <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
    <br>
    [[Continue|Carter House Backyard Swim]]
<</linkreplace>>